        "created_at": "2015-03-28T03:46:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>One way of gaining Favor is by \"A [H/V] target deals 2 or more damage to multiple non-[H/V] targets in a single turn.\"&nbsp; Does this apply when a source does multiple instances of 2+ damage -- but those instances are all done to the *same* target?&nbsp; My intuition says no, but I was uncertain enough to want other opinions.</p>",
